etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">千问App正式上线Wan2.7视频生成模型，支持视频编辑、续写与动作模仿</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布Gemma 4开源模型系列，采用Apache 2.0协议</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持多仓库自主协同</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next并开源核心架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bef7ae15e1dd4bcc97202363107ad19a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团技术团队正式发布并开源原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next，该模型摒弃了“语言基座+插件”的拼凑架构，通过自研DiNA（离散原生自回归）架构，将图像、语音与文本统一转化为同源的离散Token。在技术实现上，模型采用同一套参数、注意力机制和损失函数，通过dNaViT视觉分词器实现高达28倍的像素空间压缩，并支持任意分辨率输入。实证性能显示，LongCat-Next在OmniDocBench密集文本测试中超越Qwen3-Omni及Qwen3-VL，在MathVista视觉推理测试中达到83.1分，同时保持C-Eval 86.80的语言能力。该模型实现了理解与生成的对称，支持低延迟并行文本语音生成及语音克隆。美团此次开源LongCat-Next及dNaViT分词器，旨在为开发者提供构建感知物理世界AI的底层工</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">印度AI初创公司Sarvam AI开启3.5亿美元融资，亚马逊与英伟达拟参投</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/76c7ee7ad1ad22d40255d6693e86155c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">印度AI初创公司Sarvam AI已正式开启新一轮融资，计划筹集3亿至3.5亿美元，投后估值预计达15亿至15.5亿美元，最快有望于未来一周内完成。本轮融资由Bessemer Venture Partners领投，亚马逊、英伟达及沙特阿美旗下Prosperity7 Ventures均有意参投。成立于2023年的Sarvam AI专注于印度本土化建模，今年2月已发布参数分别为300亿和1050亿的大语言模型，重点支持22种印度语言及语音交互，目前正研发具备Agentic能力的AI系统以赋能企业自动化。此次融资反映了全球资本对深耕特定语言文化与垂直场景的“本土冠军”企业的青睐，亚马逊与英伟达的入局标志着其在南亚AI生态基座的战略布局进一步深化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">千问App正式上线Wan2.7视频生成模型，支持视频编辑、续写与动作模仿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bef7ae15e1dd4bcc97202363107ad19a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月3日，千问App正式上线Wan2.7视频生成模型，并同步集成Wan2.7-image图像模型，向全量用户开放免费体验。Wan2.7视频模型具备三大核心功能：视频编辑、视频续写与动作模仿。在视频编辑方面，用户通过自然语言指令即可实现画面元素替换（如人物、服饰、背景）、风格转换（动画、3D、黏土等）及机位调整，并支持修改角色表情、动作与台词，同时保持口型与语气的自然一致。在视频续写方面，该模型支持将2秒视频延长至15秒，通过首尾帧控制确保画面结构稳定与过渡自然。动作模仿功能则允许用户基于参考视频复刻人物动作、多人协同行为及运镜节奏。此次更新标志着Wan2.7系列图像与视频模型已在千问App实现全面落地，显著提升了视频创作的精细化控制能力与连贯性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布Gemma 4开源模型系列，采用Apache 2.0协议</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1d22e11eec6c71e104a1c8a05dcf79c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式发布新一代开源模型系列Gemma 4，并全面转向Apache 2.0开源协议。此次发布涵盖四款模型：旗舰版31B Dense支持256K上下文，单张H100即可运行；26B A4B MoE采用混合专家架构，激活参数仅3.8B；E4B与E2B则专为端侧设备优化，内存占用最低可压至1.5GB以下。性能方面，Gemma 4在AIME 2026数学测试中得分达89.2%，Codeforces ELO评分升至2150。全系模型内置可开关的“思考模式”，支持函数调用与结构化JSON输出，并配套开源Agent开发工具包（ADK）。此外，所有版本均支持图像与视频输入，小模型版本额外集成音频编码器。此次更新标志着谷歌通过极致的端侧工程化与更开放的协议，重新强化其在开源AI领域的竞争力，为开发者提</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持多仓库自主协同</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/406b78eec862fc61ca34a2776c0327d4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor团队正式发布Cursor 3版本，标志着软件开发模式从“人机协作”向“智能体自主工作”转型。该版本核心创新在于“智能体统一工作区”设计，允许用户在侧边栏集中管理本地及云端智能体，并支持通过移动端、Web、桌面及Slack等多终端启动。Cursor 3实现了本地与云端智能体的无缝切换，确保长时间任务在离线状态下仍能持续运行。在协作层面，新版本引入了简洁的差异视图UI，优化了代码变更的编辑与审查流程，同时保持对LSP、内置浏览器及各类插件的全面支持。开发者现可通过Cmd+Shift+P快捷键进入Agents Window体验新界面。Cursor团队表示，此次更新旨在为代码库的自我驱动奠定基础，未来将持续迭代编程模型，进一步提升开发者的自主编程效率与团队协作能力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
